@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title B14 — Mua vé, một Saga do Payment điều phối
actor Buyer
participant Booking
database "Booking DB" as BDB
participant Payment
database "Payment DB" as PDB
participant Gateway
participant Ticket
database "Ticket DB" as TDB
Buyer -> Booking : Tạo đơn + Idempotency-Key
Booking -> BDB : TX: order + reservation + allocations + counters
Buyer -> Payment : Bắt đầu thanh toán
Payment -> Booking : freeze-payment (subject đã xác thực)
Booking -> BDB : TX: kiểm deadline + lưu snapshot frozen
Booking --> Payment : Cùng snapshot cho retry
Payment -> PDB : TX: snapshot + attempt trước gọi cổng
Payment -> Gateway : Tạo thanh toán
Gateway -> Payment : IPN có chữ ký / query result
Payment -> PDB : TX: charge + Saga + outbox
Payment -> Booking : accept-payment qua broker
Booking -> BDB : TX: inbox + deadline/accepted charge + ISSUING + outbox
Booking --> Payment : ACCEPTED / LATE / DUPLICATE / CANCELLED
alt ACCEPTED
  Payment -> PDB : TX: confirmation + WAITING_TICKETS + outbox
  Payment -> Ticket : issue (purchase snapshot)
  Ticket -> TDB : TX: inbox + đủ tập vé + COMPLETED + outbox + delivery
  Ticket --> Payment : issuance-result
  Payment -> PDB : TX: Saga result + outbox
  Payment -> Booking : issuance-result
  Booking -> BDB : TX: inbox + COMPLETED
else không chấp nhận
  Payment -> PDB : TX: refund duy nhất theo charge
end
note over Booking,Ticket
  Mũi tên async là giao nhận ít nhất một lần qua outbox/broker/inbox.
  Không có transaction xuyên DB. Timeout phát hành không cho quyền hoàn.
end note
@enduml
